<figure id="S0.F1" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.22642v1/teaser.png" id="S0.F1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:483/263;" width="483" height="263" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 1: </span><span id="S0.F1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">WoW</span> is a world model that integrates perception, prediction, Judgement, reflection, and action. It learns from real-world interaction data and generates high-quality, physically consistent robot videos in seen and out-of-distribution scenarios, enabling real-world robotic execution.</figcaption>
</figure>
